::Capital of France:: What is the capital of France? {
	=Paris
	~Lyon#Lyon is the third-largest city.
	~Marseille
	####Paris has been the capital since the 10th century.
}

::Rivers:: Which of these rivers flow through Germany? {
	~%50%The Rhine
	~%50%The Danube
	~%-100%The Thames
}

::Sahara:: The Sahara is the largest hot desert in the world. {T}

::Everest:: Mount Everest is about {#8849:10} metres high.

